WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.650
Who's there?

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.950
Just what are you doing?

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.380
Identify yourself, villain!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.820
Flittering from the sky above...

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.490
And appearing in utmost black!

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.810
A sole wildflower...

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:22.960
Fuwari?

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.260
Appearing for one night only... the Ma...ma...

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.300
Um... what was it?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.300
Mustard... mascot night?

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.900
Oh, and I spent so much time practicing...

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.990
Do you perhaps mean to say "Masquerade Time"?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.000
The appellation I have adopted: Phantom Thief Natural!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:45.140
Halt!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.130
Just what do you intend?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.110
What is your intention riding Maxi, Fuwari?

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.600
Return to me, Maxi!

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.750
Maxi! Do you not recall who is your mistress?

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:21.230
That's right. Return to me.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.290
Now you obey. If only you'd done so from the start.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.960
Just what are you doing, Fuwari?

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.640
I have come to steal away...

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:41.020
The sorrow and anger within your heart!

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.850
Koe mo kibou mo kasanete

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:50.110
Hyaku paasento no sumairu

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:55.410
toki ga tomaru kurai no hikari hanate we are one

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:55.610
(we are one)
toki ga tomaru kurai no hikari hanate we are one

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.610
(we are one)

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:11.250
bacchiri! kyou mo minna kawaiku ne!

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:18.130
ippo agareba hirogaru sorezore no suteeji

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:24.140
pittari! kyou mo minna tsunagatteru

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:31.150
onaji yume miteryu koso yuuki ni naru yo

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:37.650
ochikondari jishin nakunaru toki mo aru kero

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:43.390
te to to tsunagi namida wo futtobashichae

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.750
koe mo kibou mo kasanete

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:50.040
hyaku paasento no sumairu

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:56.420
toki ga tomaru kurai no hikari hanate we are one (we are one)

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:59.760
tokimeki zettai mitsukeyou

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.050
minna kokyuu wo awasete

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:06.220
koko kara ippo susumeba

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.600
kimi to puripara we are one

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.730
(We are one)

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:17.070
A Pop and a Step and a Pri-Pri-Pri!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.370
What is the meaning of this?

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.320
You have opposed my machinations from the very start.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.480
And even now...

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.360
I face torture in choosing a fifth member.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.380
Yet you still seek to further frustrate me!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.100
The fruits of my thievery.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:55.310
Won't you become my friend?

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.620
Preposterous!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.740
This Friend Ticket is immortal.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:09.990
Facing rain, wind and snow...

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.140
It shall remain, undaunted!

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.430
It's been swept away!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.710
Mere detritus.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.030
As flimsy and ephemeral as you yourself.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.640
Enter the Phantom Thief Spineless Chicken!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.190
Of course you discard your Friend Ticket!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.730
How can you be so heartless?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:26.530
Begone!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.270
How about we call it quits here...

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.980
you shameless imitation Phantom Thief?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:41.560
Alas! I've proven to be the Blue Bird of Unhappiness after all-tori!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.700
Surely my mere presence brings you pain and suffering-tori!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:49.210
Toriko is only fit to dwell among the foulest insects-tori!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.400
That's not true!

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:53.290
Toriko, you're the Bird of Happiness!

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.280
I won't suffer anymore!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.710
We'll all find happiness!

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.590
Roly-Poly-chan!

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:09.340
You won't escape me again! Prenoir-pare to be befriended-Da Vinci!

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.350
I get a Kiki out of you as always, Roly-Poly-chan!

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.240
Our battle reaches a Correggio-scendo!

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.980
Da-Da-Da Vinci! Da-Da-Da Vinci!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.660
Feast your eyes on this-Da Vinci!

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:27.960
And plop!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:34.170
I ain't jo-Courbet-in'!

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:37.500
Knock, knock, knock-Kongourishiki!

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.240
Initialising the Hologrammation system!

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.460
Oh, no!

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.210
A landslide victory! Bravo, Brueghel!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.210
Wait, Roly-Poly-chan!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.470
Man, SubPara is bearitably full of holes and leaks!

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.110
It's raining cats and dogs.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.410
I recommend you all equip this.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.300
He looks as hot in goggles as any other glasses.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.420
This rain feels almost...

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.780
like Hibiki's lamentations.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.360
I guess if you went through that...

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:21.430
you might lose faith in your friends-pri.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.960
One's heart could become as bare as Bald Mountain.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.360
Impotent deploration,

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.760
truly unbearable.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:34.200
I think Hibiki's a good person, deep down.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.770
Are you kidding me?

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.530
If she's <i>good</i>, that makes me even more perfect than I already am!

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.470
Maybe that's why Falulu...

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:44.220
What are you doing, Falulu?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.990
Hibiki's a bad guy!

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:49.300
That's not true, Lala.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:54.290
In a way, Shikyouin Hibiki is quite...

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.690
straightforward.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.500
She's not shy about telling us she's a genius.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.490
She catered to us fully.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:06.790
Flying together was a ton of fun!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:14.570
You don't mean... that supercilious attitude was to spur us to greater heights?

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:16.160
Surely not.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:21.210
I love PriPara, more than anyone else does.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.480
But, you know...

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:25.910
I can't just delare her the enemy.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.460
That voice...

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.480
Mr Andou?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.620
I've kept mum to Hibiki-sama...

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.460
but I must...

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.620
There is something I must tell you.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.900
Oh, but...

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.690
If I do, it will mean a total betrayal of Hibiki-sama!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.970
No, but if I don't speak...

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.630
But on the other hand!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.830
Would you just spit it out already?

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.730
The truth is... Hibiki-sama...

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.420
wants to become a Vocal Doll, just like Falulu-sama.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.610
Just where did Andou go?

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.370
Surely he hasn't become engrossed in some puddle.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.300
Hibiki-san!

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.800
What do you lot want?

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.330
We have to talk to you-pri!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:25.770
She won't listen to anything with sentence enders!

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.150
I apologise for my rudeness.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.460
Do you really want to become a Vocal Doll?

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.400
You can't do that-pr–

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:35.020
Why would you abandon the real world?

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.220
Have you taken leave of your senses?

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.420
I understand how you idolise Vocal Dolls...

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.500
Let's go flying again!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.900
I don't think you should do it.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.490
You should think things through-kuma!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.520
Whom did you hear this from?

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:48.910
Andou?

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.900
You've betrayed me!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.440
I am deeply sorry.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.100
However...

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.230
Consider yourself dismissed!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:59.740
You can live henceforth as a masterless goat!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.320
Hibiki-sama...

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.520
I understand.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.830
You're casting aside even Andou-san-pr–

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.440
Andou is but a hired hand.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.760
What do I owe him, or he me?

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.210
You've gotta let your true feelings show, Maho-chan!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.070
You might even win back Fuwari!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.060
If you seek to impede me, you'll be let loose just like Andou!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.640
Do your worst!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.480
You are barred from PriPara!

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:30.850
Hibiki-san!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.810
You know...

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:36.570
I had no idea what you were going through!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:39.280
But if it were I...

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.150
Even if I were in your position...

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.920
I would hold faith!

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:47.210
I'd believe in my friends, even if they let me down!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.830
Well, I don't.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:49.480
Hup!

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.410
Hold on!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.680
If that's how you wanna play it, I'll turn your revolution back around-pr–!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.950
I won't let you back out of it-pr–!

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:04.030
If one of us attains the rank of Top Idol,

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:06.460
you'll acknowledge FriendAll as a rival anew,

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:09.130
and let us com-pr–te in the Spring Idol Grand Prix!

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.570
Certainly – when that day comes.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:31.470
One! Two! Pri! Pri!

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:35.390
Mirei, you contemptible fool – there's no way you can become a Top Idol.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:35.610
No one even goes to SubPara. No matter how many likes you get, it's meaningless!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.390
One! Two! Pri! Pri!

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:40.010
No one even goes to SubPara. No matter how many likes you get, it's meaningless!

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:43.440
If giving 301% won't cut it...

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:47.380
I'll ramp it up to 55301% this time-pri?

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:51.310
55301%?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.310
"Go, go, Mirei"!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.230
That's right!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:11:00.620
After that, we'll sweep the Spring Idol Grand Prix and bring Hibiki's self-flagellating Vocal Doll abitions to an end-pri!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.370
Hey, yeah!

00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:04.960
But... <i>can</i> we win?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:08.160
We don't have another choice.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.400
All right!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:17.260
Go, go, Mirei!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:19.500
Go, go...

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:53.810
Hibiki-san has ranked up to Serious Idol!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.210
Hibiki-sama is amazing!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:04.570
Hibiki-sama has this in the bag! There's no point even competing!

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.900
Mirei!

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.220
Thank you-pri.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.730
To Garuru... to all of you.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.580
Right now... I'm pri darn happy!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.830
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:33.220
Starting the Coord Change!

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:39.710
Sprinkling love and courage about, in the marching band style.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.940
The vivid colours effuse energy!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.690
Blue Sky March Coord!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.320
Pri!

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.360
Hey, you guys!

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:53.090
I'm the pop idol Mirei!

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:55.570
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.830
Go, go, Mirei!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.830
It's because you've all been there for me that I can shine infinitely!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.500
It's because you've all cheered for me...

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:11.820
That I'm gonna keep on sparkling brighter and brighter-pri!

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.780
Get ready for Mirei's happy-lucky pri-pri power!

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:21.460
Curses! At this rate, I won't even be able to listen.

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.190
Pri!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:47.730
Making Drama, switch on!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.960
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.450
Airy Change!

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.860
Gold Airy!

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.100
Amazing!

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:18.020
Mirei!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.060
Way to go!

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:22.250
Maho-chan, look at Mirei!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.470
Gold... Airy?

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:34.560
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.440
Pri!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:55.000
Miss Mirei, what a phenomenal occurrence!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.500
You've ranked up to Top Idol!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.410
Mirei!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.120
Mirei... Mirei!

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:05.790
Mirei!

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.720
Congratulations, Mirei.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.820
I can't hold back the waterworks!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.900
Your performance was so great it's reduced me to a blubbering wreck!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.130
I'm so unbearably proud of you!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:20.960
Maho-chan!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.000
I can see it...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:31.730
Clear as day, I can see it.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:35.800
The Head Disciplinarian, fresh from her greatest performance ever, is here in front of my eyes...

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.240
Pardon my intrusion.

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:44.130
I am here to report that I have become a Top Idol.

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:47.940
Therefore, please allow us to enter the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix as discussed.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.740
What more fitting gift than poppies for a pop idol?

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.160
Poppies are my favourite...

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.930
I couldn't imagine you'd really reach the rank of Top Idol.

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:05.220
Especially as you're restricted to the SubPara systems.

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:08.520
I am nothing if not capable of recognising effort where such recognition is due.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:11.010
You mean you heard my performance?

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.340
Um... yes...

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.610
Thank you!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.740
We will hold a rematch as discussed.

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:22.840
That said, you're sorely mistaken if you think you can defeat me.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:24.920
What do you mean?

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:28.040
Welcome to CelePara's Price Hour!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.890
Today I have a joyous announcement for all and sundry.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:37.600
In this Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix, both CelePara Opera Company and FriendAll

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:41.840
will hold a rematch with the Spring Coord on the line.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:46.830
However, I have made an amendment to the rules.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:52.220
The idol who successfully rings to bell will become the Princess of the Four Seasons.

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:53.210
Say what?

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:57.380
The members of the Princess of the Four Seasons' team

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:59.680
shall automatically become a Princess Team...

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:03.930
This team can enter the PriPara Dream Parade.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.620
And further to this, the one who, by ringing the Charm Bell,

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:12.670
receives the miracle of their wish being granted is the Princess of Four Seasons alone.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.460
Have I made myself understood?

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:20.740
Essentially, the Spring Dream Idol
Grand Prix is both a team competition

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:24.690
and the arbiter of the one who stands at the apex of PriPara.

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.300
An individual event?

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.340
If we want to stop Hibiki's wish from coming true

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:32.320
we have to win this event.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:35.170
I want to help Hibiki.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:40.840
And... if I become the Princess of Four Seasons...

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.680
Impossible. That's because <i>I'm</i> the one–

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.210
Don't kid yourself! Ol' Dorothy's got this one in the bag!

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.230
A demon's power is infinite!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:51.500
I wanna eat all the seasonal fruits at once with Aroma!

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.370
I have to become the Princess of Four Seasons!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:56.840
Yep!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.000
I'm giving it my all.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.970
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:03.880
<i>I don't want to let anything sad happen</i>

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:06.290
<i>in the PriPara I love so much!</i>

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:09.180
Please look forward to the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:14.130
She's twisting the rules according to her own whims again and again.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:17.280
I can only hope this doesn't place undue stress on the system.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.730
Falulu, what do you think?

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.920
I mean, about how Hibiki said she wants to become a Vocal Doll.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.810
It made me happy.

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:35.280
It did?

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:40.200
It's lonely, being myself every night.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.550
I'm sure I'll have lots of fun with Maho-chan.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.170
I can't be with you at night.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.060
Say, Sophie...

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:58.770
What did you feel, seeing Mirei activate Gold Airy?

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:01.880
Unlike we in our CelePara ivory towers,

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:06.970
Mirei reached that supreme stage in the dilapidated SubPara through blood, sweat and tears alone.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:11.160
The sense of defeat resounds through me.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.950
I wasn't there for Mirei...

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:18.000
when she toiled under the yoke of Hibiki's tyranny.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:23.660
I wonder if I placed myself higher than my friends.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:30.700
Salutations.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.620
Have you tired of the water fountain?

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:33.720
Hibiki-san!

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.290
I have a matter to discuss with you.

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:41.770
I want to invite you to join CelePara Opera Company, Reona.

00:22:15.530 --> 00:22:17.330
No way, no way, no way!

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:20.290
There's no way you can join that strumpet Hibiki's team!

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:21.890
Hold on, Dorothy! You see...

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:25.260
You're staying right by my side, Reona. No one else can have you!

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:27.740
Next time, <i>Revenge of Celebrity 4</i>.

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.770
Seriously? Those guys again?
